# 13. BOOKING AND QUOTATION SYSTEM

This is the central transaction workflow.

Build a complete booking engine.

Support two booking methods:

A. DIRECT BOOKING

For providers who offer predefined services at known prices.

B. REQUEST A QUOTE

For jobs requiring inspection or custom pricing.

## Customer booking workflow

Step 1: Select service.

Step 2: Choose provider.

Step 3: Describe the job.

Step 4: Upload relevant photographs if necessary.

Step 5: Select location.

Step 6: Choose preferred date and time.

Step 7: Review pricing or request a quotation.

Step 8: Submit booking request.

Step 9: Receive confirmation or provider response.

Step 10: Track booking progress.

