Use secure server-side LLM integration.

Do not expose API keys.

Do not allow AI to directly access arbitrary database queries.

Use controlled backend tools.

Require explicit confirmation before AI initiates a booking or any financial transaction.

Provide graceful fallback if AI services are unavailable.

